sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as 👤 Analyst / Planner
    participant App as 🖥️ Streamlit App<br/>(app/streamlit_app.py)
    participant Storage as 📁 Output Storage<br/>(outputs/)
    participant VRT as 🗺️ Rasterio VRT<br/>(WarpedVRT EPSG:4326)
    participant Stats as 📊 Analytics Engine<br/>(NumPy / Pandas)
    participant Folium as 🌍 Folium Map<br/>(st_folium)

    Note over Analyst, Folium: <b>Scenario: Analyst selects year and views land-cover map with trajectory</b>

    Analyst->>App: Select Year (e.g., 2025) via dropdown
    activate App

    App->>Storage: Locate landcover_2025.tif
    Storage-->>App: File handle

    App->>VRT: load("landcover_2025.tif")
    activate VRT
    VRT->>VRT: Reproject to EPSG:4326 & resample (MAX_PX=1500)
    VRT-->>App: Return 2D array, bounding box & px_ha
    deactivate VRT

    App->>Stats: areas(full_array, px_ha)
    activate Stats
    Stats->>Stats: np.bincount(v) * px_ha across 6 classes
    Stats-->>App: DataFrame (hectares per class)
    deactivate Stats

    App->>App: to_rgba(arr) with 6-class hex palette
    App->>Folium: overlay_map(rgba_png, bounds)
    activate Folium
    Folium->>Folium: Create folium.Map + ImageOverlay
    Folium-->>App: Rendered interactive map HTML/canvas
    deactivate Folium

    App->>Storage: Read annual_class_areas_2019_2025.csv
    Storage-->>App: 7-year area trajectory data

    App->>App: st.line_chart(df_ann)
    App-->>Analyst: Display interactive map, class area table & 7-year trend
    deactivate App
